WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.024 --> 00:00:05.273
One, I believe in God,
I know some people don't,

00:00:05.273 --> 00:00:11.570
many people who don't nonetheless believe
in something greater than themselves.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.443
I believe that, if you believe in
something greater than yourself,

00:00:15.443 --> 00:00:18.195
that your life will be more full and
productive.

00:00:18.195 --> 00:00:20.951
So I believe in God, and
by the way, in believing in God,

00:00:20.951 --> 00:00:23.730
I believe therefore we
are all His children.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:26.713
And I believe that God loves all of us,
and

00:00:26.713 --> 00:00:30.561
I believe He loves us as you
would love your children.

00:00:30.561 --> 00:00:33.409
Some are doing naughty things, some are
doing nice things, but you love them all.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:39.054
And I believe that I will be measured,
and you will be measured.

00:00:39.054 --> 00:00:43.413
Based upon what you have done for
your fellow children of God, and

00:00:43.413 --> 00:00:48.340
that means your spouse, your children and
your community more broadly.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:52.813
So that's a big part of
what's important to me,

00:00:52.813 --> 00:00:55.372
which are the people
around me that I care for.

00:00:55.372 --> 00:00:59.417
The person I care for most of the life
is my wife, we met in high school,

00:00:59.417 --> 00:01:01.040
I love her passionately.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.628
She is the most important person in my
life, if I could do anything on any day,

00:01:05.628 --> 00:01:07.190
it would be to be with her.

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:09.201
That's what I enjoy most in life.

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:15.529
Close thereafter is to be with my kids, my
boys and their wives and now 23 grandkids.

00:01:15.529 --> 00:01:19.410
The greatest joy I have in
life is being with them.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:23.125
Sitting around in the backyard or at
a beach, just being with my grandkids and

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:26.910
family is the greatest source of happiness
and the most important thing to me.

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:30.416
Coming beyond that is a circle which
includes my church, my congregation,

00:01:30.416 --> 00:01:33.120
the people I know at church and
my sense of service to them.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.635
Service in the broadest sense,

00:01:37.635 --> 00:01:42.476
giving back in the sense of caring for
people around me.

00:01:42.476 --> 00:01:45.811
Follows from that belief in
something bigger than myself.

00:01:45.811 --> 00:01:49.117
I happen to belief that the currency in
life, is the people that you love and

00:01:49.117 --> 00:01:50.550
that care for you.

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:54.141
The friends you have, most of what
you've learned here you'll forget.

00:01:54.141 --> 00:01:57.665
The people you've met here you'll
remember the rest of your life.

00:01:57.665 --> 00:02:00.020
And will form a big part
of your of your wealth.

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:04.200
That's your balance sheet when life is
over, who loves you and you love, and

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.921
who are your friends and
how close are they to you.

00:02:06.921 --> 00:02:08.770
So, what's the most important thing to me?

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:13.640
My God, my wife, my kids, and
my fellow human beings and

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:17.707
I participate and
engage with people at large.

00:02:17.707 --> 00:02:23.845
Through campaigns, through speeches,
through serving at charities,

00:02:23.845 --> 00:02:29.891
in all sorts of ways and the rewards
that come back are rewards in people.

00:02:29.891 --> 00:02:34.748
In friendship, in love, and that's
what makes the most impact in my life.

